     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Comment from Sourceforge Task&#93;</span><br/>\nComment Submitter: cwilper<br/>\nThis task resulted in two branches, one for services/oaiprovider, and one for fedora.  The one for Fedora was done to support the oaiprovider changes.  It:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>improves logging configuration<br/>\n  (FedoraClient never auto-sets the commons-logging properties)</li>\n\t<li>implements equals() and hashCode() for the PID class.</li>\n\t<li>Allows 3.0+ client to work with server release 2.2.2</li>\n</ul>\n",
